<rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>go-wasmcontainers – Start</title><link>https://go-wasmcontainers.github.io/docs/main/tags/start/</link><description>Recent content in Start on go-wasmcontainers</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>en</language><atom:link href="https://go-wasmcontainers.github.io/docs/main/tags/start/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Getting started</title><link>https://go-wasmcontainers.github.io/docs/main/getting-started/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://go-wasmcontainers.github.io/docs/main/getting-started/</guid><description>
&lt;div class="hx:overflow-x-auto hx:mt-6 hx:flex hx:rounded-lg hx:border hx:py-2 hx:ltr:pr-4 hx:rtl:pl-4 hx:contrast-more:border-current hx:contrast-more:dark:border-current hx:border-amber-200 hx:bg-amber-100 hx:text-amber-900 hx:dark:border-amber-200/30 hx:dark:bg-amber-900/30 hx:dark:text-amber-200"&gt;
&lt;div class="hx:ltr:pl-3 hx:ltr:pr-2 hx:rtl:pr-3 hx:rtl:pl-2"&gt;&lt;svg height=1.2em class="hx:inline-block hx:align-middle" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 9v2m0 4h.01m-6.938 4h13.856c1.54 0 2.502-1.667 1.732-3L13.732 4c-.77-1.333-2.694-1.333-3.464 0L3.34 16c-.77 1.333.192 3 1.732 3z"/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="hx:w-full hx:min-w-0 hx:leading-7"&gt;
&lt;div class="hx:mt-6 hx:leading-7 hx:first:mt-0"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;There is nothing to install yet.&lt;/strong&gt; The engine has no release and no command
to run: its image and root-filesystem packages are being written. This page
says what M1 will let you do, and is updated when it does.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 data-hextra-search-id="building-from-source-today"&gt;Building from source (today)&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="building-from-source-today"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#building-from-source-today" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;The engine is a Go module that needs Go 1.27.3 or later:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-code-block hx:relative hx:mt-6 hx:first:mt-0 hx:group/code"&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-sh" data-lang="sh"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;git clone https://github.com/go-wasmcontainers/engine
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="nb"&gt;cd&lt;/span&gt; engine
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;go build ./...&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-copy-btn-container hx:opacity-0 hx:transition hx:group-hover/code:opacity-100 hx:flex hx:gap-1 hx:absolute hx:m-[11px] hx:right-0 hx:top-0"&gt;
&lt;button
class="hextra-code-copy-btn hx:group/copybtn hx:cursor-pointer hx:transition-all hx:active:opacity-50 hx:bg-primary-700/5 hx:border hx:border-black/5 hx:text-gray-600 hx:hover:text-gray-900 hx:rounded-md hx:p-1.5 hx:dark:bg-primary-300/10 hx:dark:border-white/10 hx:dark:text-gray-400 hx:dark:hover:text-gray-50"
title="Copy code"
aria-label="Copy code"
data-copied-label="Copied!"
&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-copy-icon hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:hidden hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-success-icon hx:hidden hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:block hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;That compiles the packages; there is no &lt;code&gt;wctrd&lt;/code&gt; or &lt;code&gt;wctr&lt;/code&gt; command to start until
the daemon and its API are written.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-hextra-search-id="the-session-m1-is-written-to-serve"&gt;The session M1 is written to serve&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="the-session-m1-is-written-to-serve"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#the-session-m1-is-written-to-serve" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Planned for M1 (native, wazero executor).&lt;/strong&gt; Once &lt;code&gt;wctrd&lt;/code&gt; is running and
listening on &lt;code&gt;/var/run/wctr.sock&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;wctr&lt;/code&gt; finds it by itself; &lt;code&gt;WCTR_HOST&lt;/code&gt; points
it elsewhere:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-code-block hx:relative hx:mt-6 hx:first:mt-0 hx:group/code"&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-sh" data-lang="sh"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;wctr pull &amp;lt;image&amp;gt; &lt;span class="c1"&gt;# an OCI image with os=wasip1, arch=wasm&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;wctr run &amp;lt;image&amp;gt; &lt;span class="c1"&gt;# runs the module under wazero&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;wctr ps &lt;span class="c1"&gt;# lists the containers&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;wctr logs &amp;lt;container&amp;gt; &lt;span class="c1"&gt;# its standard output and error&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;wctr inspect &amp;lt;container&amp;gt; &lt;span class="c1"&gt;# its configuration and state&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;wctr images &lt;span class="c1"&gt;# lists the pulled images&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;wctr rm &amp;lt;container&amp;gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;wctr rmi &amp;lt;image&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-copy-btn-container hx:opacity-0 hx:transition hx:group-hover/code:opacity-100 hx:flex hx:gap-1 hx:absolute hx:m-[11px] hx:right-0 hx:top-0"&gt;
&lt;button
class="hextra-code-copy-btn hx:group/copybtn hx:cursor-pointer hx:transition-all hx:active:opacity-50 hx:bg-primary-700/5 hx:border hx:border-black/5 hx:text-gray-600 hx:hover:text-gray-900 hx:rounded-md hx:p-1.5 hx:dark:bg-primary-300/10 hx:dark:border-white/10 hx:dark:text-gray-400 hx:dark:hover:text-gray-50"
title="Copy code"
aria-label="Copy code"
data-copied-label="Copied!"
&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-copy-icon hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:hidden hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-success-icon hx:hidden hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:block hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Anything else (&lt;code&gt;wctr exec&lt;/code&gt;, building an image, Compose, published ports) is
&lt;strong&gt;planned, not part of M1&lt;/strong&gt;; see the &lt;a href="https://go-wasmcontainers.github.io/docs/main/roadmap/"&gt;roadmap&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-hextra-search-id="where-to-follow-it"&gt;Where to follow it&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="where-to-follow-it"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#where-to-follow-it" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;The engine&amp;rsquo;s progress is in
&lt;a href="https://github.com/go-wasmcontainers/engine" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;go-wasmcontainers/engine&lt;/a&gt;; the
page you are reading describes its &lt;code&gt;main&lt;/code&gt; branch.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>